Landowner hunting coupons-hunts that harvest
HB0281
no animal.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Winter and Williams
AN ACT relating to game and fish; requiring hunters to deliver landowner coupons
to a landowner when using a landowner's property for hunting antelope, deer or
elk; authorizing landowners to redeem landowner coupons whenever the majority
of a hunt for antelope, deer or elk occurred on the landowner's property; and
providing for an effective date.
